          "normalized_title": "Quitting Alcohol Can Change the Brain in Surprising Ways, Mouse Study Finds",
          "normalized_summary": "Researchers found unusually high BNST activity in abstinent mice that later showed compulsive-like alcohol drinking. For some people, a period without alcohol can later be followed by more compulsive drinking. In mice undergoing abstinence, our research team found that changes in the activity of a specific brain region appeared before this compulsive drinking behavior, raising [...]",
